Challenge: Find a file in the inhere directory with these properties:

Human-readable
1033 bytes
Not executable

Solution:

cd inhere
find -readable -size 1033c \! -executable
cat ./maybehere07/.file2

Explanation:

find searches recursively.
-size 1033c means exactly 1033 bytes.
\! means no
\! -executable excludes executable files.
file identifies text files.

